    a: 'Yes, you can save Snapchat videos to your iPhone camera roll using Safari — paste the Snapchat link into TikSaveHub, tap Download HD, then tap "Save Video" from your Safari Downloads. On iPhone, open Safari and navigate to TikSaveHub. Paste the Snapchat link, download the MP4, then go to Safari → Downloads → tap the file → tap "Save Video" to move it to your Photos app. No computer needed.',
