    q: 'What quality are Snapchat Spotlight downloads?',
    a: 'TikSaveHub downloads Snapchat Spotlight videos in the highest available quality — typically 720p or 1080p depending on the creator\'s upload. Paste the Spotlight URL and tap "Download HD Video". The original MP4 is served directly from Snapchat\'s CDN, preserving the exact quality the creator uploaded.',
